2026-07-27T11:13:28.0709221Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:13:28.0709797Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:13:28.0710651Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
